cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "ShallowSeabed: Unreal Engine 5 Synthetic Underwater Scene Simulator"
abstract: >-
  Descoped Unreal Engine 5.8 synthetic underwater scene simulator with a custom
  stencil-ID instance annotation pipeline, built as part of an MSc Robotics
  dissertation at the University of Sheffield before the project pivoted to a
  diffusion-model generation pipeline (see ImgGen_AI).
authors:
